### AI Recruiter Resume Upload
We want to extract text from PDF and DOCX files directly. Rather than adding heavy native C bindings (like pdf-parse) on Windows that could fail during backend compilation, we will handle this efficiently in the client browser using lightweight CDN-loaded libraries or standard array buffers:
* **PDF Reader:** We can dynamically load `pdfjs-dist` from a CDN (or bundle it) globally to parse PDF page-by-page.
* **DOCX Reader:** We will use `mammoth` (a lightweight JS library) loaded dynamically from unpkg/cdnjs to extract raw text content from `.docx` files.

#### [MODIFY] [AiAssistant.jsx](file:///c:/Users/vlanj/OneDrive/Desktop/MailPilot/client/src/pages/AiAssistant.jsx)
* Add support for file types `.pdf`, `.docx` in the file input.
* Implement dynamic script loaders for `pdfjs-dist` and `mammoth` (or direct client-side parsing utilities) to extract raw text from selected files and populate the Resume text box.

